  "solution": "The logic followed in the given sets is:\n\n**Logic: (First number × Last number) × 12 = Middle number.**\n\n**(10, 360, 3)**\n\n→ (10 × 3) × 12\n\n→ 30 × 12\n\n→ 360 = Middle number\n\n**(12, 720, 5)**\n\n→ (12 × 5) × 12\n\n→ 60 × 12\n\n→ 720 = Middle number\n\n**1) (11, 956, 8)**\n\n→ (11 × 8) × 12\n\n→ 88 × 12\n\n→ 1056 ≠ 956\n\n**2) (13, 1009, 7)**\n\n→ (13 × 7) × 12\n\n→ 91 × 12\n\n→ 1092 ≠ 1009\n\n**3) (8, 576, 6)**\n\n→ (8 × 6) × 12\n\n→ 48 × 12\n\n**→ 576 = 576**\n\n**4) (17, 816, 3)**\n\n→ (17 × 3) × 12\n\n→ 51 × 12\n\n→ 612 ≠ 816\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 3\".**",
